### Variáveis para VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@lang = pt-BR
@professorEmail = professor@acadflow.local
@studentEmail = aluno@acadflow.local
@demoPassword = change-me-1234

### 1. Health check (público)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login como Professor
# @name loginProfessor
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "email": "{{professorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

###
@professorToken = {{loginProfessor.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. Login como Aluno
# @name loginStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "email": "{{studentEmail}}",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

###
@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Usuário autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 5. Listar disciplinas (paginação, filtro e ordenação)
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines?page=1&perPage=20&sortField=name&sortDirection=asc&filter={"semester":"2026.2","search":"BD"}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 6. Criar disciplina (PROFESSOR)
# @name createDiscipline
POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "code": "ES-221",
  "name": "Engenharia de Software",
  "semester": "2026.2",
  "description": "Requisitos, arquitetura e testes"
}

###
@disciplineId = {{createDiscipline.response.body.id}}

### 7. Consultar disciplina por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 8. Editar disciplina (code e semester são imutáveis)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "name": "Engenharia de Software I",
  "description": null
}

### 9. Listar alunos matriculados na disciplina (PROFESSOR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 10. Listar atividades da disciplina
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 11. Criar atividade (visível imediatamente aos alunos matriculados)
# @name createActivity
POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "title": "Trabalho 1 - Arquitetura",
  "description": "Diagrama C4 e ADRs",
  "dueAt": "2026-11-30T23:59:00Z"
}

###
@activityId = {{createActivity.response.body.id}}

### 12. Editar atividade
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/activities/{{activityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "title": "Trabalho 1 - Arquitetura e ADRs",
  "dueAt": null
}

### 13. Lançar ou atualizar nota (idempotente — substitua @studentId por um ID válido)
@studentId = 00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000000
PUT {{baseUrl}}/activities/{{activityId}}/grades/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "value": 8.5
}

### 14. Consultar notas e médias da turma (PROFESSOR)
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 15. Consultar próprias notas e média (ALUNO matriculado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}/grades/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 16. Excluir atividade (retorna 409 se houver notas ou anexos)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/activities/{{activityId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 17. Excluir disciplina (retorna 409 se houver matrículas ou atividades)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

### 18. Exemplo de erro traduzido em inglês (Accept-Language: en)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "email": "{{professorEmail}}",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

# ==============================================================================
# Rotas Pós-MVP (disponíveis nas branches ACA-24 e ACA-25)
# ==============================================================================

### [ACA-24] Consultar / atualizar meu perfil
# GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
# Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}

### [ACA-24] Buscar alunos elegíveis para matrícula (mínimo 3 caracteres)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}/students/candidates?search=ana
# Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}

### [ACA-24] Matricular aluno manualmente
# POST {{baseUrl}}/disciplines/{{disciplineId}}/students/{{studentId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{professorToken}}

### [ACA-25] Listar anexos de uma atividade
# GET {{baseUrl}}/activities/{{activityId}}/attachments
# Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

